Mouse visual mode combines wheel scrolling, click positioning, and drag selection.
.py, C/C++ extensions, and .sh/.bash use line-local language highlighting.
Extensionless bash/sh shebangs select shell highlighting.
Markdown fences support python/py, bash/sh/shell, c, and cpp/c++/cc/cxx.
Recovery and manual versions use protectdir; autosave still writes the original.
`auto` uses XDG state, `file` uses adjacent hidden files, and PATH is explicit.
Central artifacts use basename plus an absolute-path hash and contain no path metadata.

